rn, otherwise RS Semitic i. 469, 2nd ed., 488 ); ( נָשִׁים ) שְׁתֵּי Gen 4:19 132t., 1Sam 10:4 insert כִּכְּרוֺת Klo HPS Bu Now; Lev 16:21 read dual יָדָיו Qr, + Judg 16:28 (see above) + שְׁתֵּיאֵֿלֶּה Isa 47:9 both these things ; before singular noun, שְׁנֵי Exod 16:22 (Ges § 134e ); suffix שְׁנֵיתֶם the two of them Gen 2:25 62t., + Prov 24:22 (&gt; their years ᵑ7 ᵑ6 De and others; probably corrupt, see Toy), שְׁנֵינוּ Gen 31:37 2 t., שְׁנֵיכֶם 27:45 ; שְׁתֵּיהֶם (masculine suffix! Ges § 135o ) Ruth 1:19 ; 4:11 , יֵ֯הֶן 1Sam 25:43 ; Ezek 23:13 . b. absolute (1) שְׁנַ֫יִם (90 t.), before plural noun Judg 11:37 26 t.; after plural noun 2Sam 1:1 ; Exod 29:1 + 21 t. (usually P Chronicles), singular noun (collective) Gen 46:27 ; Num 7:17 11 t. Numbers 17; noun omitted Gen 7:2 ; 44:27 26 t.; ׳שׁ ׳שׁ distributive 7:9 +; ׳לִשׁ cut in two 2Kin 3:25 ; Jer 34:18 ; = double amount Exod 22:3 ; 22:6 ; 22:8 (E); שׁ ׳מִּי Deut 21:17 double portion , + בְּרוּחֲךָ 2Kin 2:9 in (of) thy spirit , + בָּהּ Zechariah 3:18; -2 שְׁתַּ֫יִם (55 t.) before plural noun 1Kin 3:16 16 t.; after plural noun (usually P and late) 2Chr 24:3 9 t.; noun omitted, = two things Isa 51:19 ; Job 13:20 ; Prov 30:7 ; שְׁתַּיִם = twice 2Kin 6:10 ; Job 40:5 ; Psa 62:12 (or as Prov 30:7 ), ׳בִּשׁ Job 33:14 either so, or in two ways RVm (see De); as ordinal לְ שְׁתַּיִם בִּשְׁנַת 1Kin 15:25 9 t., etc.; (3) as round number, עֵצִים שְׁנַיִם 17:12 a few sticks (German 'ein paar'), compare 2Kin 9:32 ; Isa 17:6 ; שָׁלשׁ שְׁתַּיִם Amos 4:8 , וּשְׁתָּ֑יִם מַּעַם Neh 13:20 , compare Jer 3:14 מִמִּשְׁמָּחָה וּשְׁנַיִם מֵעִיר אֶחָד = a small number; Ezra 10:13 not for one or two days (but for many), 2Kin 6:10 . 2 twelve: with noun masculine עָשָׂר שְׁנֵים Gen 42:13 87t., עָשָׂר לִשְׁנֵי Exod 28:21 4 t.; with noun feminine עֶשְׂרֵה שְׁתֵּים Exod 24:4 34t., עֶשְׂרֵה שְׁתֵּי Ezek 32:1 , 17 ; 33:21 ; before plural noun Gen 17:20 ; Exod 15:27 +; after plural noun Num 7:84 (twice in verse) +; before singular noun Exod 28:21 +, Gen 14:4 (12 year ) +, etc.; as ordinal, עָשָׂר שְׁנֵים בְּיוֺם יוֺם Num 7:78 , שָׁנָה עֶשְׂרֵה בִּשְׁתֵּי Ezek 32:1 +, etc. 3 with larger number: 10 (etc.) + 2, 2Sam 8:5 ; Judg 10:3 56t.; 2 10(etc.) Num 1:35 (P), 2Chr 22:2 18t. (Kö ii. 1. 215 ff. Ges § 97f .); 200 2+ 30, 1Kin 20:15 ; 502as ordinal 2Kin 15:27 2 t.; compare 2 + 20, 1Chr 24:17 .","rootNote":"dual of 8145 ; feminine שְׁתַּיִם ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 19","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 19","1Chr 4 5","1Chr 6 48","1Chr 7 2","1Chr 7 7","1Chr 9 22","1Chr 11 21","1Chr 11 22"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":769,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנֵ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmdc"},{"reference":"1Chr 4 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":4,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁתֵּ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfdc"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 48","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":48,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁתֵּ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcfda"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנַ֥יִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acmda"},{"reference":"1Chr 7 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנַ֨יִם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acmda"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנֵ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acmda"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 21","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַ/שְּׁנַ֨יִם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Acmda"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁנֵ֤י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAcmdc"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁנָֽיִם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Acmda"},{"reference":"1Chr 15 10","book":"1Chr